Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 08:15:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] Fix manual boxes, profiles and undo bugs

- Manual boxes are now stored per app (manual-<package>). They used to be
  global, so a box drawn in Chrome also showed over WhatsApp.
- Switching apps no longer rewrites the 'hide all black boxes' switch.
- The shade or system UI on top no longer counts as 'no app', which used to
  hide every box for a moment; swizy's own screen still counts as no app.
- Boxes captured for a new profile show only in the app being captured.
- Saving an existing profile no longer renames it; the name uses the captured
  package, not whatever app is in front when Save is pressed.
- Undo history is cleared when the foreground app changes, and a move or
  resize that changes nothing is no longer an undo step.
- A cancelled touch (system back gesture) leaves selection, move and resize
  mode instead of getting stuck in it.
- The draw loop skipped the dragged box with 'continue' after canvas.save(),
  leaking the save and its clip; the skip now comes before the save.
